Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.39,0:00:05.39,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1906.666,614.667)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果\N使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！\N翻译质量权威评价：原来25年就有小拉即用机翻糊弄人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:02.52,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone. In this video, I want to show you something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:04.92,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,cool you can do with Since most a Chromiumbas based browser.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.63,0:00:09.83,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,browsers are just Chrome derivatives, I think it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.91,0:00:13.55,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,it's going to work on like 90% of the browsers out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:17.32,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,And you can impress your friends with this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.47,0:00:20.74,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,or something. So, here is the thing. You can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:23.79,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,if you're using Edge, using Chrome
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:27.66,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,or any other Chrome derivative really, you can just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.27,0:00:42.05,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Hit enter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:45.88,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and your browser crashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:55.30,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,it no longer works. I mean, you have to you have to close it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.27,0:01:00.21,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,There you go. Once you reopen it, it's it's going to be good. It's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:03.22,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, that's a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.91,0:01:07.79,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,there are a couple more flags that sound hip
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:11.12,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,that sound gangster, you can look them up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.81,0:01:21.87,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,And you have a list of something URLs depends on the fork.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.19,0:01:26.21,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,since Edge is a Chromium fork, they just edited the strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:28.80,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,And at the very end right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:31.21,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,you see um for debug category.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.29,0:01:37.42,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,here is all the stuff you can
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.14,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,insert into the address bar and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:44.07,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,basically just enjoy enjoy the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.32,0:01:51.63,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,it's been here for a while. I guess it's been here for years
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.03,0:01:55.45,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and, I was really surprised to learn that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:59.38,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,not a lot of people knew about this and just kind of blew up on Twitter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:00.48,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and people were like,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.74,0:02:03.32,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,"What? What the heck? This actually worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:06.69,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,No way. This actually crashed my browser."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:09.60,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, I just wanted to make a quick video
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.89,0:02:16.13,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,to highlight you can induce the browser crash for reals on any Chromium derivative.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.02,0:02:20.67,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,yeah, have fun with this. Impress your friends. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.77,0:02:23.58,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks for watching. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:02.52,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,大家好。在这个视频里，我想向大家展示一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:04.92,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,很酷的功能，这个功能可以在大多数基于Chromium的浏览器中实现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.63,0:00:09.83,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,浏览器不过是Chrome的衍生品罢了，我觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.91,0:00:13.55,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,它能在市面上90%的浏览器上运行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:17.32,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,你可以用这个或类似的东西给你的朋友留下深刻印象
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.47,0:00:20.74,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,所以，事情是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:23.79,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你用的是Edge、Chrome
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:27.66,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,或任何其他基于Chrome的浏览器，你完全可以输入这个URL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:31.04,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,(/▽＼)不要盯着人家惠惠(Megumin)啦~ 好好看视频操作 (✿◡‿◡)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.27,0:00:42.05,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,猛按回车键
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:45.88,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,然后浏览器崩溃了耶~~~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:55.30,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,现在它动不了了，只能强制关闭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.27,0:01:00.21,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,就是这样。 再次打开它，一切都好起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:03.22,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.91,0:01:07.79,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,还有几个听起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:11.12,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,很潮、很野的标志
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.81,0:01:21.87,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,根据不同的分支，你会有一个包含某些URL的列表
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.19,0:01:26.21,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,由于Edge是Chromium的一个分支，他们只是修改了字符串
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:28.80,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,而在最后这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:31.21,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,你会看到调试分类
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.29,0:01:37.42,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,以下是你可以
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.14,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,输入地址栏的所有内容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:44.07,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,基本上就是享受这场表演
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.32,0:01:51.63,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,它已经存在一段时间了。我猜它已经存在好几年了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.03,0:01:55.45,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,而且，我真的很惊讶地发现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:59.38,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,没有多少人知道这件事，只是在推特上突然火了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:00.48,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,人们都惊了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.74,0:02:03.32,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,“啥？搞什么鬼？这居然真能行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:06.69,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,不可能吧。这真的把我的浏览器搞崩了。”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:09.60,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,所以呢，我就想快速做个视频强调一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.29,0:02:12.29,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1917.867,312.267)}原标题：The Coolest Way to Crash a Browser 原作者：Enderman\N原视频上传日期：2025年4月29日
